#: ../source/authentication.rst:2
#: 1044489854724660841f4f664377057f
msgid "Authentication & authorization"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:5
#: 64b844189c4e43c1a7f15dcb00db0ead
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:7
#: 12bc4b996ff74ebd829ea8dde47d2ad5
msgid "Users are authenticated with OpenID Connect (OIDC), through `ProConnect <https://www.proconnect.gouv.fr>`__ (which federates the identity providers of the French administration, including Cerbère)."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:10
#: 0363d2758c5844979ef0480f8785080d
msgid "backend : the backend is an OIDC client (Spring Security ``oauth2Login``). The frontend redirects the user to ``/oauth2/authorization/proconnect`` ; after a successful login, the backend opens a session for the user. Only users whose email belongs to one of the authorized email domains are accepted."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:13
#: 33fa72cdf58e458db225c885a7194eb4
msgid "frontend : the login page shows a ProConnect or a Cerbère login button (``FRONTEND_OIDC_LOGIN_BUTTON_PROVIDER``). Users without an account are invited to request one by email."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:16
#: 48f074c2da2f4c5daba62698d015f339
msgid "Authentication can be disabled (e.g. for local development) with the ``monitorfish.oidc.enabled`` property."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:19
#: 8dcade6fb5894780937dbec2bc12c318
msgid "Authorization"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:21
#: 26768f143cca434e8c56390f16bbc74e
msgid "We store users authorization in a custom ``user_authorizations`` table : the hashed email (SHA256) of the user is used to authorize users. Each user is either :"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:24
#: c87419dc277b4aa6970639b15897775b
msgid "a **super user** (FMC agents), who has access to all features"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:25
#: 980318ee91a8452594b051ced3805282
msgid "a regular user (other administrations, e.g. control units), who has access to a subset of features"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:27
#: e2dd32cc0023464bafadbe2edcdf4653
msgid "See :doc:`access-rights` for the features available to each type of user."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:29
#: 5dbed50ce19442f595353ad4f38a0311
msgid "Routes of the frontend API (``/bff/v1/*``) require an authorized user, and some routes require a super user."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:31
#: dfb3a54bae4d400ca05bbd84f264ddfd
msgid "Users are managed by other applications through the ``/api/v1/authorization/management`` endpoint of the public API."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:34
#: adaa3307bae94e1e9aa509590daaf1b1
msgid "Public API"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/authentication.rst:36
#: 8eaf7abcafb44686af5d8ed22a0a4379
msgid "Protected routes of the public API (``/api/v1/*``), used by other systems (Monitorenv, RapportNav...), require an API key sent in the ``x-api-key`` header."
msgstr ""
